@startuml flyweight_problem_context
title Flyweight - bez wzorca: 6 obiektow, dane wspolne zduplikowane

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150

package "Bez Flyweight (6 obiektow Glyph)" {
    card "Glyph #1\n---\nSymbol: 'A'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}\n---\nx=10, y=20\ncolor=black" as G1
    card "Glyph #2\n---\nSymbol: 'A'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}\n---\nx=40, y=20\ncolor=red" as G2
    card "Glyph #3\n---\nSymbol: 'A'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}\n---\nx=70, y=20\ncolor=blue" as G3
    card "Glyph #4\n---\nSymbol: 'B'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}\n---\nx=100, y=20\ncolor=black" as G4
    card "Glyph #5\n---\nSymbol: 'A'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}\n---\nx=130, y=20\ncolor=green" as G5
    card "Glyph #6\n---\nSymbol: 'C'\nFont: Arial\nMetrics: {...}\n---\nx=160, y=20\ncolor=black" as G6
}

note bottom
Symbol + Font + Metrics sa identyczne dla 4 obiektow 'A'.
Pamiec: 6 x ~70B = ~420B (z duplikatami danych wspolnych).
end note

@enduml
